{"id": "355", "title": "捡到一个坐台小姐", "author": "湖墨南国", "category": "都市言情", "count": 294, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/355.htm", "intro": "坐台小姐，成了时代的女强人；\r\n 　　捡破烂的，成了反恐英雄。\r\n 　　这不是靠运气，而是靠实力、靠奋斗。它送给今天这个时代的年轻人一个成功的秘诀，它指给正在艰苦创业的后生们一个前进的方向,它警示大权在握的高官们，权利并非他们的私有财产。这就是这部小说的魅力所在。\r\n 　　这是全国唯一一部以奥运反恐题材为内容的长篇小说，随着2008北京奥运的临近，小说也已进入最精彩的章节。17K文学网连载的《捡到一个坐台小姐》是本书唯一的网络正版。\r\n 　　欢迎您收藏本书精装本和正版阅读。", "base": "files/article/html/0/355", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "54867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "54868.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "54869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "54870.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "54871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "54872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "54873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "54874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "54875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "54876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "54877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "54878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "54879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "54880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "54881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "54882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "54883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "54884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "54885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "54886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "54887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "54888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "54889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "54890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十五章", "file"